%%{init: {'theme': 'base', 'themeVariables': {'primaryColor': '#e3f2fd', 'primaryBorderColor': '#1565c0', 'lineColor': '#37474f'}}}%%

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as SwapRouter
    participant P as UniswapV3Pool
    participant BM as TickBitmap
    participant TK as Tick storage
    participant O as Observations array
    participant C as Callback (payer)

    R->>P: swap(recipient, zeroForOne, amountSpecified,<br/>sqrtPriceLimitX96, data)
    P->>P: Load slot0: sqrtPriceX96, tick, observationIndex,<br/>feeProtocol, unlocked. Set unlocked = false.

    loop while amountRemaining != 0 and price != limit
        P->>BM: nextInitializedTickWithinOneWord(tick, tickSpacing, zeroForOne)
        BM-->>P: next initialised tick, or the word boundary
        P->>P: SwapMath.computeSwapStep:<br/>how much fits before that tick,<br/>at the current liquidity, net of fee
        alt step consumes the whole remaining amount
            P->>P: Move sqrtPriceX96 partway, exit loop
        else step reaches the tick
            P->>TK: tick.cross(feeGrowthGlobal0X128, feeGrowthGlobal1X128)
            TK-->>P: liquidityNet for that tick
            P->>P: liquidity += liquidityNet (sign flips by direction)
            Note over P: Positions bounded here activate or<br/>deactivate. Gas rises with each crossing.
        end
        P->>P: feeGrowthGlobalXX128 += feeAmount * Q128 / liquidity
    end

    P->>O: write(observationIndex, blockTimestamp, tick, liquidity)
    Note over O: tickCumulative += tick * secondsElapsed<br/>secondsPerLiquidityCumulativeX128 += secondsElapsed * Q128 / liquidity
    P->>P: Update slot0 with the final sqrtPriceX96 and tick
    P->>C: uniswapV3SwapCallback(amount0Delta, amount1Delta, data)
    C->>P: transfer the owed token
    P->>P: require balance increased by the owed amount, unlocked = true
